e\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease. EVD-076 static-import server warningCount564/reportAny125, EVD-077 full local block exit0 with catalog8/8; source init→static transition is probe-only. Actual Stage3 NOT_RUN. Write-mode range formatting must run on disposable candidate copy and assert_frozen(copy), never write product during architecture probe.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-004\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RISK-009\",\n      \"scenario\": \"Prompt POST timeout уже после принятия способен удвоить generation при silent fallback\",\n      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n      \"impact\": \"high\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"Текущий brief RW-001 выбирает HTTP response headers / первый current-session execution event как delivered barrier, вместо R1 начала POST. До headers и без события ServeUnavailable может fallback после полного kill/reap старого PGID; remote generation могла уже начаться, exactly-once не обещать. После barrier silent run запрещён; только явный same-transport retry+status/cap, no builtin execution. Source disagreement записан в panel_resolution_choices.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-001\",\n        \"VER-005\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RISK-010\",\n      \"scenario\": \"SIGTERM/leader exit оставляет descendant, старый cleanup ждёт15+5с\",\n      \"probability\": \"high\",\n      \"impact\": \"high\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"Normal cleanup<=1.2s; SIGKILL/kickstart-k outside finally protected by parent-pipe helper + safe startup lease reaper. Persist child identity before prompt; validate owner/ps start-time/PGID/cmd/inode and foreign-process negative tests. H0/H9 actual orphan sweep NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-001\",\n        \"VER-005\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RISK-011\",\n      \"scenario\": \"Статусы [мост] сохраняются DSH и при ручном переключении модели могут попасть reasoning_content другого provider (F-33/F-38/F-39)\",\n      \"probability\": \"medium\",\n      \"impact\": \"medium\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"Принятый остаточный риск: current bridge игнорирует весь replay reasoning, но чужой provider этого не обязан делать. Короткие статусы только grace/реальное ожидание не чаще5s и один на retry, no secrets/prompt text. Не менять DSH/provider контракты; уменьшить объём синтетики. Fake replay проверяет только этот мост, cross-provider H4 наблюдение не заменяет гарантии.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-005\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RISK-012\",\n      \"scenario\": \"Serve SSE/protocol деградация ошибочно открывает общий model breaker и блокирует рабочий run\",\n      \"probability\": \"high\",\n      \"impact\": \"high\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"_ServeHealth threshold3/TTL120/one recovery probe для новых auto requests, protocol failure не _UpstreamBreaker. Current accepted prompt не переигрывать скрыто. Fake5requests + expiry/probe/version-change cases; настоящие provider429/5xx сохраняют model breaker.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-005\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"threat_model\": {\n    \"required\": true,\n    \"assets\": [\n      \"промпт и история владельца\",\n      \"ключ моста, пароль serve и proxy credentials\",\n      \"локальные файлы и процессы\",\n      \"квота Zen и ресурсы станции\"\n    ],\n    \"trust_boundaries\": [\n      \"DSH -> bridge OpenAI HTTP (auth без изменений)\",\n      \"bridge -> одноразовый loopback serve Basic Auth\",\n      \"serve -> georouter/Zen через унаследованный per-spawn env\",\n      \"модель -> запрос инструмента: исполнение только в DSH\"\n    ],\n    \"threats\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"THREAT-001\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Подмена локального serve listener и утечка пароля/промпта или сигнал чужому процессу\",\n        \"mitigation\": \"Родитель резервирует 127.0.0.1:0 и запускает только helper_proc с argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], start_new_session=True; child_pgid=helper_proc.pid. Helper устанавливает EOF/TERM надзор до spawn, атомарно публикует lease и запускает serve_proc с start_new_session=False в той же группе child_pgid; публикует serve_pid/serve_lstart до handshake/READY. --serve-helper <attempt_id> находится в первых аргументах ps -ww argv. До отправки любых Authorization/пароля или prompt обязательны одновременно listener_pid == serve_pid, os.getpgid(listener_pid) == child_pgid и helper_proc.poll() is None; ровно один lsof с бюджетом <=0.35s внутри общего ready<=3.0s. На mismatch/timeout/неоднозначность 0 байт Authorization/пароля/prompt, fail-closed, retry только внутри исходного ready/cap3 после cleanup. Cleanup os.killpg(child_pgid, SIGTERM→SIGKILL) охватывает подтверждённые собственные helper + serve + потомков, с lifeline/reap/root+lease cleanup по crash_recovery; чужой PID в той же или иной группе получает 0 байт пароля и 0 сигналов чужому PGID. Секреты только sanitized env, без argv/lease/log; no redirects/proxy. Normal Keep-Alive control path не вызывает повторный lsof; отдельный explicit reconnect имеет собственный proof, как listener_ownership. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early 