10s, не ждать prompt completion. deny selectable до attempt, никогда auto-switch/разрешение или silent run fallback после delivered; unsupported capability/policy ->fail-closed. For form.created first inspect nested data.form object: if data.form.sessionID==active_session_id and data.form.id is a nonempty string, latch single-turn/Step2 barrier and IMMEDIATELY send POST /api/session/{id}/form/{formID}/cancel on retained control lane<=0.25s, then interrupt<=0.10s, BEFORE validating title/fields/metadata or emitting invalid_serve_event. EVD-073 source Form.Info requires id,sessionID,title,fields (only root metadata optional; field-level title/required optional). Missing root title is a schema discrepancy but safety cancel is authoritative: successful cancel+interrupt completes normal cancelled attempt with ServeHealth+0/UpstreamBreaker+0, no watchdog60s wait and no Step2. This does not relabel source title optional. Missing/invalid id or sessionID ->immediate fail-closed(no foreign cancel); cancel failure/control disconnect ->immediate fail-closed; parent finally killpg(child_pgid) completes<=1.2s, no watchdog wait. Valid foreign nested sessionID ignored with0foreigncontrol. form.cancelled.data.id/sessionID settles only same owned form; not model token or first-event. Полный single_turn_control.order авторитетен: raw tool args/input.ended fallback сохраняются, готовый mapped call возвращается ровно один раз finish_reason=tool_calls, иначе существующее recovery в cap3; никакого Step2. _run_env, tests/test_run_env.py побайтно неизменны. EVD-050 + [F-08] обосновывают выбор ask_reject; FakeServe не доказывает живую Zen-совместимость или запрет записи, это H6 NOT_RUN.\",\n        \"verification_ids\": [\n          \"VER-005\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"THREAT-003\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Unrestricted parent env утекает в serve или proxy creds в ошибку\",\n        \"mitigation\": \"_run_env only standalone branch whitelists; opencode-go/static inherit parent env baseline. New _serve_env filters exact allowlist on ALL3 branches before generated password/DB/state values, preserving only required routing/catalog/proxy/auth paths. OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_* and arbitrary API_KEY/TOKEN/SECRET sentinels absent; config/log/lease redacted. See AD-001.serve_env_sanitization; VER-005 branch matrix. _run_env remains byte-identical. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\",\n        \"verification_ids\": [\n          \"VER-005\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"THREAT-004\",\n        \"scenario\": \"SSE из чужой session или reconnect replay приводит к чужому выводу/повтору инструмента\",\n        \"mitigation\": \"Filter exact data.sessionID и own prompt-send generation boundary; session v2 не даёт executionID, не ожидать выдуманного поля. subscribe armed before prompt, no transparent reconnect/replay after delivered; event id + assistantMessageID step/call id dedup; no foreign/raw events in public stream.\",\n        \"verification_ids\": [\n          \"VER-005\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"THREAT-005\",\n        \"scenario\": \"Отмена клиента/oversized frame держит процессы и позволяет resource exhaustion\",\n        \"mitigation\": \"bounded byte queue/frame/output and slots/waiters, finite per-operation deadlines, own PGID forced cleanup, zero orphan tests; output overflow не дропается молча. Crash leases + parent-pipe helper + startup reaper with uid/pid/pgid/start_ts/command/inode verification; no foreign signals/name-wide cleanup.\",\n        \"verification_ids\": [\n          \"VER-005\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evolution\": {\n    \"compatibility\": \"Existing public endpoints/schema/Google unchanged; run fallback retained. OPENCODE_DB=:memory: и standard auth/models/config сохранены. Кодовый default=false и отсутствие runtime JSON в git гарантируют378baseline по run; native auto включается атомарным runtime true только на H7 после H3/H6, без start.sh/restart и без новых env-переменных для самого фичефлага; диагностические/override env пакета перечислены отдельно в AD-001/AD-003.\",\n    \"migration\": \"No product DB migration. serve child SQLite memory only; never read/write/migrate shared opencode.db/opencode-next.db. Owned zen-serve-state-* dirs and UID registry leases are transient control state removed normally/following crash-safe reaper. Standard XDG_DATA_HOME/auth.json kept read-only.\",\n    \"rollout\": \"Все H0..H9 NOT_RUN, external a6/panel/arch/r15 ACCEPT+panel proof и независимые VER gates обязательны; Architect не выполняет rollout. H0 BLOCKING до sync/restart: проверить текущий env не force serve/true, отсутствие production dynamic_config.json либо boolean false; при прежнем enabled состоянии атомарно записать false, проверить read-back; дополнительный disable-serve разрешён. Снять старые PID/start/lease identity. H4 sync/read-back server.py hash; H5 launchctl kickstart с config absent/false: сразу dark run без окна serve; startup reaper0 старых собственных serve/helper/temp roots, чужие процессы untouched. На отдельном кандидате test-local dynamic_config.json=true и отдельный disable-file path: provider-free info/active, H3 реальные6parallel RSS/FD+OPENCODE_DB=:memory:, H6 live permission/tool isolation, Stage3a/A затем3b/B. На production до H7 run. H7 ТОЛЬКО после PASS H3 и H6: при env auto без explicit false и закрытом TTL подготовить tempfile в ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/,0600, записать {\\\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\\\":true}, os.replace в dynamic_config.json; убедиться дополнительный disable-serve отсутствует. Следующий native auto запрос на :9883 использует serve без правки start.sh и без повторного рестарта LaunchAgent. H8 повторяет живые проверки рабочего чата, H9 проверяет runtime false/true и disable-file same PID, отдельно kickstart-k crash recovery. Никакой выдачи design/NOT_RUN за runtime PASS. H4 uses ONLY cp bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py, then SHA-256 read-back. Never rsync --delete or directory sync. Preserve live dynamic_config.json and disable-serve byte-for-byte (or their recorded absence) from H0 snapshot AFTER any intentional H0 false-write; H0/H4 read back existence/bytes/mode after cp. H5 restarts only after that preservation check; no copy/delete/overwrite of either runtime file. Default=false and true only H7 after H3/H6, no new owner waiver required.\",\n    \"rollback\": \"Runtime kill-switch без рестарта: атомарно tempfile+os.replace mode0600 записать {\\\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\\\":false} в ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/dynamic_config.json; либо удалить файл (default=false), либо создать disable-serve. Следующий auto запрос run без serve probes/allocations. Цель selector overhead <1мс проверяется VER-005/H9; это не измеренная гарантия задержки файловой записи/планировщика. Существующий explicit env=true имеет заданный override приоритет: в таком диагностическом процессе использовать disable-file для безусловного runtime rollback; production H0/H7 требуют auto без override. Env false/no/off/0 или TRANSPORT=run также force run, но изменение env живого процесса требует restart. In-flight leases drain/cancel, DELIVERED prompt не повторяется на run. H9 проверяет same PID, transport_history и повторные/параллельные вызовы; kickstart-k отдельно с config false/absent и identity-verified owned reaper. Stage2 ничего не деплоит. Все H0..H9 NOT_RUN.\",\n    \"feature_flag\": \"Кодовый дефолт REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED=false. Локальный runtime dynamic_config.json — stdlib-аналог dynamic_config.py/GigaRC автономного моста без внешних зависимостей: H0 отсутствие файла или boolean false удерживает run; H7 атомарно включает true только после успешных H3 (6 параллельных слотов RSS/FD с OPENCODE_DB=\\\":memory:\\\") и H6 (живая permission/tool изоляция на кандидате). Без исключений из канона или human waiver; без новых env-переменных для самого фичефлага REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED через dynamic_config.json и без правок start.sh/LaunchAgent; никакой записи dynamic_config.json в git. Новые диагностические/override env-переменные этого пакета: OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_TRANSPORT, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_PERMISSION_POLICY, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_DISABLE_FILE и watchdog overrides OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_EVENT_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT_S, OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_STALL_TIMEOUT_S (AD-003). Сам рабочий фичефлаг REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED переключается boolean в dynamic_config.json без новой env для переключения и без правки start.sh/LaunchAgent; кодовый default=false, включение H7 только после H3/H6.\",\n    \"H3_rollout_gate\": {\n      \"status\": \"NOT_RUN\",\n      \"scenario\": \"6 parallel реальных рабочих prompt около103KB +7th overload,3повтора; изолированный candidate перед production sync и повтор на боевом после safety допуска\",\n      \"memory_unit\": \"MiB\",\n      \"memory_inequality\": \"Units MiB. EVD-079 final actual helper peak=31.718750; helper_estimate36.0 reserves 4.281250 for Stage3 helper code/lease/drain bookkeeping (design allowance, not live proof). Serve idle156.8 + helper36.0 =192.8; probe8.0 -> combined200.8; per_slot_ceiling216.0 gives15.2>=15 MiB for103KB prompts.6*216=1296 shared;1296+256=1552.0<=0.80*2048=1638.4; station headroom86.4.6slots/12waiters/cap3 unchanged. H3 NOT_RUN until live6parallel103KB×3; any actual slot>216 or total>1638.4 blocks H7 without waiver. Helpers/probes/load must be summed, not omitted.\",\n      \"database_gate\": \"OPENCODE_DB=:memory:,0 shared SQLite opens/writes (lsof + disk identity snapshot);0database is locked/SQLITE_BUSY across6parallel×3; valid opencode-go auth without false401 tested separately from provider-free readiness.\",\n      \"other_evidence\": \"Реальные RSS/FD/CPU/TTFT каждого запроса, parent/child peaks, все owned temp dirs удалены, zero orphan PGID; design child216MiB не подставлять вместо замера Include lsof one per spawn, helper/watchdog PIDs,18 admitted handler threads (6active+12waiters), consistent12 drains, observed FD/thread peaks and transport diagnostics. /api/info+active provider-free first; measured ready120.7ms is baseline not guarantee. Same tree helper_proc(new session leader)->serve_proc(same child_pgid). Record<=19total processes,55admitted parent threads,transient parentFD<=128 and344aggregate design; helper EOF single-thread and both lifeline ends accounted. Exceedance fails H3,not waiver.\",\n      \"on_fail\": \"Rollout enable запрещён: runtime config остаётся absent/false (и дополнительный disable-file остаётся, если поставлен). Не повышать slots6/12/retrycap3 и не менять shared env/config/DB. Any measured combined slot>216 MiB or total>1638.4 MiB blocks H7 without waiver; do not replace measured values with estimates.\"\n    },\n    \"H0_precondition\": {\n      \"status\": \"NOT_RUN\",\n      \"blocking\": true,\n      \"ordered_steps\": [\n        \"verify production TRANSPORT=auto and no explicit enabled env override\",\n        \"verify dynamic_config.json absent or boolean REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED=false; if enabled atomically write false0600 and read-back before sync/restart\",\n        \"optional additional disable-serve; preserve recorded safety state\",\n        \"H0 snapshot exact bytes/hash/existence/mode of dynamic_config.json and disable-serve after intentional safety false-write; H4/H0 read-back same state after copying ONLY server.py.\",\n        \"capture old PID/start/leases\",\n        \"H4 sync candidate bytes/read-back hash\",\n        \"H5 kickstart-k in dark run; reaper0 previous own serve/helper/temp roots\",\n        \"candidate H3 six parallel RSS/FD memoryDB and H6 permission/tool isolation PASS before H7\",\n        \"H7 atomic tempfile+os.replace0600 runtime true; remove optional disable-file only at this enable gate; no start.sh change/restart\"\n      ],\n      \"owner\": \"rollout operator; not Architect\"\n    },\n    \"H9_crash_recovery_gate\": {\n      \"status\": \"NOT_RUN\",\n      \"scenario\": \"Same live bridge PID: atomic runtime config false ->run, true ->serve при native+healthy, file deletion ->run; disable-serve дополнительно always run. Подтвердить selector overhead<1мс фактом, не обещанием. Отдельно parent hard kill/kickstart-k с active serve и последующий startup reaper:0 собственных orphan serve/helper/temp roots, чужие PID/PGID untouched.\"\n    },\n    \"H4_H5_sync_contract\": {\n      \"status\": \"NOT_RUN\",\n      \"copy_command\": \"cp bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py\",\n      \"forbidden\": [\n        \"rsync --delete\",\n        \"directory-wide sync\",\n        \"copy/delete/overwrite live dynamic_config.json\",\n        \"copy/delete/overwrite disable-serve\"\n      ],\n      \"preservation_gate\": \"H4 uses ONLY cp bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py ~/.dsh/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py, then SHA-256 read-back. Never rsync --delete or directory sync. Preserve live dynamic_config.json and disable-serve byte-for-byte (or their recorded absence) from H0 snapshot AFTER any intentional H0 false-write; H0/H4 read back existence/bytes/mode after cp. H5 restarts only after that preservation check; no copy/delete/overwrite of either runtime file. Default=false and true only H7 after H3/H6, no new owner waiver required.\",\n      \"H5\": \"launchctl kickstart only after H0/H4 copied server hash and both runtime file preservation checks; false/dark until H7\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"approval\": {\n    \"status\": \"NOT_REQUIRED\",\n    \"decision_ids\": [],\n    \"approved_by\": null,\n    \"evidence_ref\": null,\n    \"rationale\": \"FU-007 закрыт без исключений из канона: кодовый дефолт REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED переведён в false, а включение на :9883 выполняется через локальный runtime dynamic_config.json (stat mtime_ns кэш без рестарта и без правки start.sh) строго на шаге H7 после прохождения H3/H6. Все AD обратимы (two-way); status=APPROVED означает валидированный архитектурный пакет-кандидат для Архитектурного Совета a6 (panel/arch/r15), а не вердикт Совета.\"\n  },\n  \"independent_review\": {\n    \"required\": false,\n    \"status\": \"NOT_REQUIRED\",\n    \"reviewer\": null,\n    \"evidence_ref\": null,\n    \"rationale\": \"S2 schema NOT_REQUIRED unchanged; downstream external a6 (panel/arch/r15) Council/proof remains mandatory. a5 NEEDS_WORK is input history; revision v6 is internally ready for external review only. Author issues no Council PASS or ARCH_GATE_PASS.\"\n  },\n  \"open_questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q-001\",\n      \"question\": \"OPEN08/09: Каковы measured RSS/CPU/SQLite contention/actual TTFT и proxy egress на103KB/6parallel?\",\n      \"blocking\": false,\n      \"disposition\": \"Не блокирует Stage2 contract; H1/H2/H3 блокируют runtime enabling до доказательства design budgets.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q-002\",\n      \"question\": \"H6: совместимы ли с реальным Zen default ask_reject и optional env=deny при гарантированном builtin rejection?\",\n      \"blocking\": false,\n      \"disposition\": \"Default выбран, автопереключения нет. FakeServe обе policy не доказывает live H6; неизвестная safe capability fail-closed, до H6 боевой disable-file не снимать.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q-003\",\n      \"class\": \"continuable\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false,\n      \"question\": \"FU-007 закрыт compliant flag delta: кодовый default=false плюс локальный runtime dynamic_config.json; human waiver не нужен.\",\n      \"owner\": \"owner/orchestrator\",\n      \"blocks\": \"Нет блокера policy; H3/H6/H7 и независимый a3 review остаются обязательны.\",\n      \"evidence_ids\": [\n        \"EVD-074\"\n      ],\n      \"blocking\": false,\n      \"source_id\": \"FU-007/a2\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"disposition\": \"По явной финализации architect-cycle-3b; runtime проверки NOT_RUN.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"protected_paths\": [\n    \".ai-team/\",\n    \"analysis/zen-realtime-reasoning/\"\n  ],\n  \"materialization\": [],\n  \"deferred\": [\n    \"Живая приёмка H0..H9 и синхронизация ~/.dsh выполняются только rollout-этапом после clean-room verifier и downstream panel.\",\n    \"OPEN-05/16: прямой Zen HTTP и другие CLI форматы не исследуются заново; текущая реализация использует подтверждённый v2 SSE.\",\n    \"Измеренные CPU/RSS/FD и реальный proxy egress на 103 KB/6 parallel — обязательный rollout gate, не доказанный Stage 2 факт.\",\n    \"ADR-0005: оформить docs/adr/0005-zen-serve-realtime-reasoning.md и обновить docs/adr/INDEX.md отдельной задачей вне замороженного handoff-architect.md §10. Текущий Read-Only Product Gate разрешает только3 run JSON, поэтому materialization=[] и ADR/product docs здесь не создаются.\"\n  ],\n  \"verification_policy\": {\n    \"surface_frozen\": true,\n    \"verification_implementation_owner\": \"Stage 3 Coder пишет tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py; Stage L2 Verifier независимо запускает каждый VER с 0 failed; тесты не считаются выполненными Stage 2\",\n    \"REQ-019_clean_room\": \"VER-005 проверяет digest/rollout-manifest helper на двух временных fake files внутри sandbox, не ~/.dsh. Реальная синхронизация REQ-019 проверяется только H0 после отдельного rollout; невозможно подтвердить факт deploy чистым unit-тестом.\",\n    \"timing\": \"FakeClock/RNG и Event-oracles для invariants; socket arrival/CPU реальные измерения отдельными measured/heavy unittest TestCase внутри dedicated suite (stdlib-discover тоже исполняет их). Тест timing держит upstream Event закрытым до чтения 10 дельт, deadline<500ms для interarrival и<=250ms bridge overhead; timeout helper аварийно освобождает Event, чтобы assertion failure не зависала. Не подменять arrival resp.read().\",\n    \"order\": \"Dedicated suite запускает selected TestStepInterruptionLive tests минимум в двух противоположных фиксированных порядках в subprocess/новых Server, включая error после budget tests; без случайных seed/dependency.\",\n    \"wire_fixture\": \"Six frozen source-schema families, canonical digest serialization explicit; five original family literals retained and nested form family added, adversarial mutations independent adapter/FakeServe.\",\n    \"strict_typing\": \"Decode wire JSON as object with isinstance narrowing/TypedDict; new code no Any/casts-to-Any/type-ignore. VER-004 uses isolated bridge cwd + temporary include/extraPaths: all3 errorCount==0, new test0diagnostics, server Any<=125each/nonAny per-rule and total<=720, step<=194; changed legacy code0reportAny/reportExplicitAny/reportUnusedCallResult. Preserve public module attribute server.CATALOG_SOURCE and HTTP catalog_source: module-level CATALOG_SOURCE = \\\"static\\\", never rename it or external test references. Replace reload_catalog global CATALOG_SOURCE/reassignment with typed def _set_catalog_source(source: str) -> None: globals()[\\\"CATALOG_SOURCE\\\"] = source; keep only _catalog_mtime/_catalog_ids in reload_catalog global declaration. Preserve static import zen_catalog as zc in the normal-server else branch (original import server.py:67); it remains the only permitted E402 location if a finding exists, zero E402 findings is valid; guard proc is not None before both final stream .returncode reads. EVD-076 observed errorCount0 without # type: ignore; tests/test_catalog_mode.py:64,93 unchanged,8tests PASS on copy. coder_target_files remains exactly3; no config/dependency/new module. Full all3 Stage3 gate NOT_RUN. Ruff==0.17.2 legacy ranges use only --range={start}:1-{end}:999; reject any old/new diff hunk intersecting _run_env/_stream_google_sse/_execute_google_once and check their literal raw hashes before and after formatter. Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease. EVD-076 static-import server warningCount564/reportAny125, EVD-077 full local block exit0 with catalog8/8; source init→static transition is probe-only. Actual Stage3 NOT_RUN. Write-mode range formatting must run on disposable candidate copy and assert_frozen(copy), never write product during architecture probe.\"\n  },\n  \"high_load_envelope\": {\n    \"schema\": \"HL-ENV/v1\",\n    \"ssot\": \"~/Мой диск/skils/ai-sdlc/python/aisdlc-gcge/agents/architecture.md §3.0/7.2\",\n    \"field_count\": 46,\n    \"units\": \"SSoT §3.0: memory MiB; times s, CPU cores, rates req/s or conn/s, connections/descriptors/tokens; векторы d и s по канону.\",\n    \"required_hl_env_fields\": {\n      \"P_steady\": 1,\n      \"P_hpa_max\": 1,\n      \"maxSurge_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"maxSurge_abs\": 0,\n      \"maxUnavailable_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"maxUnavailable_abs\": 0,\n      \"P_terminating_overlap\": 0,\n      \"P_live\": 1,\n      \"P_avail_min\": 1,\n      \"W\": 1,\n      \"N_proc\": 1,\n      \"N_proc_steady\": 1,\n      \"N_proc_avail_min\": 1,\n      \"CPU_limit_per_pod\": 2.0,\n      \"κ_skew\": 1.0,\n      \"u_bg_worker\": 0.02,\n      \"U_pod_sidecars\": 0.25,\n      \"Mem_limit_per_pod\": 2048,\n      \"Mem_rss_worker_max\": 256,\n      \"Mem_shared_max\": 1296,\n      \"RPS_peak\": 0.2,\n      \"A_max\": 3,\n      \"SLA_p99_s\": 180.0,\n      \"N_entities_max\": 64,\n      \"Limit_dep_share[d]\": {\n        \"georouter\": 80,\n        \"opencode_local_db\": 10\n      },\n      \"Limit_dep_rps[d]\": {\n        \"opencode_spawn\": 1.0\n      },\n      \"W_fetchers[d]\": {\n        \"opencode_spawn\": 0\n      },\n      \"J_init_s[d]\": {\n        \"opencode_spawn\": 12.0\n      },\n      \"J_pod_s[d]\": {\n        \"opencode_spawn\": 12.0\n      },\n      \"T_poll_s[d]\": {\n        \"opencode_spawn\": 15.0\n      },\n      \"K_calls[d]\": {\n        \"opencode_spawn\": 0\n      },\n      \"T_base_s[d]\": {\n        \"opencode_spawn\": 0.5\n      },\n      \"T_cap_s[d]\": {\n        \"opencode_spawn\": 2.0\n      },\n      \"Max_stale_age_s[c]\": {\n        \"stateless_bridge\": 0.0\n      },\n      \"Min_healthy_ratio\": 1.0,\n      \"B_retry_max\": 6,\n      \"min_reserve_retry_rps\": 0.05,\n      \"FD_worker\": 128,\n      \"ulimit_n\": 65536,\n      \"λ_new_conn_per_pod(s)\": {\n        \"node_ephemeral\": 3.6,\n        \"shared_snat\": 1.8\n      },\n      \"C_active_in_scope(s)\": {\n        \"node_ephemeral\": 30,\n        \"shared_snat\": 12\n      },\n      \"N_pods_in_scope(s)\": {\n        \"node_ephemeral\": 1,\n        \"shared_snat\": 1\n      },\n      \"Port_range_size(s)\": {\n        \"node_ephemeral\": 16384,\n        \"shared_snat\": 16384\n      },\n      \"T_hold_s(s)\": {\n        \"node_ephemeral\": 60.0,\n        \"shared_snat\": 60.0\n      },\n      \"SNAT_ips_count(s)\": {\n        \"node_ephemeral\": 1,\n        \"shared_snat\": 1\n      },\n      \"HOTPATH_MODULES\": [\n        \"bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"field_sources\": {\n      \"P_steady\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"P_hpa_max\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"maxSurge_pct\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"maxSurge_abs\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"maxUnavailable_pct\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"maxUnavailable_abs\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"P_terminating_overlap\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"P_live\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"P_avail_min\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"W\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"N_proc\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"N_proc_steady\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"N_proc_avail_min\": \"F-12/F-34; один локальный ThreadingHTTPServer/LaunchAgent, без HPA/rolling deployment; derived поля рассчитаны при single-process; план rollout без overlap.\",\n      \"CPU_limit_per_pod\": \"analysis/zen-realtime-reasoning/handoff-architect.md §7; оценка design envelope, не измеренный host limit/SLA; OPEN-08/09/11; перепроверить H1/H2/H3.\",\n      \"κ_skew\": \"analysis/zen-realtime-reasoning/handoff-architect.md §7; оценка design envelope, не измеренный host limit/SLA; OPEN-08/09/11; перепроверить H1/H2/H3.\",\n      \"u_bg_worker\": \"analysis/zen-realtime-reasoning/handoff-architect.md §7; оценка design envelope, не измеренный host limit/SLA; OPEN-08/09/11; перепроверить H1/H2/H3.\",\n      \"U_pod_sidecars\": \"analysis/zen-realtime-reasoning/handoff-architect.md §7; оценка design envelope, не измеренный host limit/SLA; OPEN-08/09/11; перепроверить H1/H2/H3.\",\n      \"Mem_limit_per_pod\": \"handoff-architect §7 design budget2048MiB, normalized per SSoT§3.0/RW-011; host limit not measured, H3 mandatory.\",\n      \"Mem_rss_worker_max\": \"F-29 parent baseline22MiB; design bound256MiB; H3 actual_parent_RSS_max measured in MiB.\",\n      \"Mem_shared_max\": \"Units MiB. EVD-079 final actual helper peak=31.718750; helper_estimate36.0 reserves 4.281250 for Stage3 helper code/lease/drain bookkeeping (design allowance, not live proof). Serve idle156.8 + helper36.0 =192.8; probe8.0 -> combined200.8; per_slot_ceiling216.0 gives15.2>=15 MiB for103KB prompts.6*216=1296 shared;1296+256=1552.0<=0.80*2048=1638.4; station headroom86.4.6slots/12waiters/cap3 unchanged. H3 NOT_RUN until live6parallel103KB×3; any actual slot>216 or total>1638.4 blocks H7 without waiver. Helpers/probes/load must be summed, not omitted.\",\n      \"RPS_peak\": \"analysis/zen-realtime-reasoning/handoff-architect.md §7; оценка design envelope, не измеренный host limit/SLA; OPEN-08/09/11; перепроверить H1/H2/H3.\",\n      \"A_max\": \"F-11/server.py:287-314; max spawns=3, retry tokens=6, refill=.05/s, backoff=.5/2s.\",\n      \"SLA_p99_s\": \"180s normal-mode design goal from analyst envelope; degraded first-token failure profile3*60+51.6=231.6s separate explicit acceptance, not guaranteed180s or universal generation limit. See operational_profile.p99_criteria; actual measurements NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"N_entities_max\": \"analysis/zen-realtime-reasoning/handoff-architect.md §7; оценка design envelope, не измеренный host limit/SLA; OPEN-08/09/11; перепроверить H1/H2/H3.\",\n      \"Limit_dep_share[d]\": \"F-26 georouter 80 direct slots; opencode_local_db=10 — design logical-child share из handoff, НЕ доказанный sqlite pool/max_connections; H3 проверяет фактическую contention и ≤6 children.\",\n      \"Limit_dep_rps[d]\": \"F-11/server.py:309-314 — локально установленный spawn limiter 1/s, НЕ квота Zen/SQLite vendor. Запросы не являются pollers; не подставлять это число как upstream RPS quota.\",\n      \"W_fetchers[d]\": \"F-12/F-14 и граф BND: новый source per-request, Control Plane/Snapshot poller не добавляется; 0 фоновых fetchers и 0 background calls. SSE keepalive не backend polling.\",\n      \"J_init_s[d]\": \"F-10/F-04: 12s startup gate и 15s legacy keepalive как inherited nominal fields, фактических pollers=0. Новая client liveness cadence≤2s описана AD-003 и не backend poll.\",\n      \"J_pod_s[d]\": \"F-10/F-04: 12s startup gate и 15s legacy keepalive как inherited nominal fields, фактических pollers=0. Новая client liveness cadence≤2s описана AD-003 и не backend poll.\",\n      \"T_poll_s[d]\": \"F-10/F-04: 12s startup gate и 15s legacy keepalive как inherited nominal fields, фактических pollers=0. Новая client liveness cadence≤2s описана AD-003 и не backend poll.\",\n      \"K_calls[d]\": \"F-12/F-14 и граф BND: новый source per-request, Control Plane/Snapshot poller не добавляется; 0 фоновых fetchers и 0 background calls. SSE keepalive не backend polling.\",\n      \"T_base_s[d]\": \"F-11/server.py:287-314; max spawns=3, retry tokens=6, refill=.05/s, backoff=.5/2s.\",\n      \"T_cap_s[d]\": \"F-11/server.py:287-314; max spawns=3, retry tokens=6, refill=.05/s, backoff=.5/2s.\",\n      \"Max_stale_age_s[c]\": \"Stateless transport; новый Snapshot/secret TTL cache не создаётся. process-local capability boolean по stat не хранит secrets/model output и инвалидируется при mtime/size смене.\",\n      \"Min_healthy_ratio\": \"analysis/zen-realtime-reasoning/handoff-architect.md §7; оценка design envelope, не измеренный host limit/SLA; OPEN-08/09/11; перепроверить H1/H2/H3.\",\n      \"B_retry_max\": \"F-11/server.py:287-314; max spawns=3, retry tokens=6, refill=.05/s, backoff=.5/2s.\",\n      \"min_reserve_retry_rps\": \"F-11/server.py:287-314; max spawns=3, retry tokens=6, refill=.05/s, backoff=.5/2s.\",\n      \"FD_worker\": \"Design parent ceiling128;steady108=36baseline+18clients+18HTTP+12helperdrains+6reserve+6probe pipes+6lifeline_w+6leasehandles;transient6lifeline_r=>114<=128.6serve/6helper/6bounded lsof-or-ps probes separate FD,system344estimate. H3 per-process/transient peaks mandatory.\",\n      \"ulimit_n\": \"F-29 launchctl soft maxfiles=65536; не переносить значение вчерашнего reference packet=4096 как текущий факт.\",\n      \"λ_new_conn_per_pod(s)\": \"AD-001: <=3 readiness connects including reusable control, +1 SSE +1 prompt delivery +1 egress =6 per attempt; node<=6*.2*3=3.6conn/s; active<=5*6=30 incl client+3HTTP+egress. sharedSNAT1.8/active12 estimate unchanged; H3 validate.\",\n      \"C_active_in_scope(s)\": \"AD-001: <=3 readiness connects including reusable control, +1 SSE +1 prompt delivery +1 egress =6 per attempt; node<=6*.2*3=3.6conn/s; active<=5*6=30 incl client+3HTTP+egress. sharedSNAT1.8/active12 estimate unchanged; H3 validate.\",\n      \"N_pods_in_scope(s)\": \"handoff-architect §7 локальный host (49152..65535 inclusive=16384); topology/SNAT=1 и TIME_WAIT=60s — design assumptions, внешний shared-SNAT capacity неизвестен; H3/rollout подтвердить.\",\n      \"Port_range_size(s)\": \"handoff-architect §7 локальный host (49152..65535 inclusive=16384); topology/SNAT=1 и TIME_WAIT=60s — design assumptions, внешний shared-SNAT capacity неизвестен; H3/rollout подтвердить.\",\n      \"T_hold_s(s)\": \"handoff-architect §7 локальный host (49152..65535 inclusive=16384); topology/SNAT=1 и TIME_WAIT=60s — design assumptions, внешний shared-SNAT capacity неизвестен; H3/rollout подтвердить.\",\n      \"SNAT_ips_count(s)\": \"handoff-architect §7 локальный host (49152..65535 inclusive=16384); topology/SNAT=1 и TIME_WAIT=60s — design assumptions, внешний shared-SNAT capacity неизвестен; H3/rollout подтвердить.\",\n      \"HOTPATH_MODULES\": \"HOTPATH_MODULES: текущий server.py, read-only symbol graph BND-001..004; новые проектные modules не нужны.\"\n    },\n    \"operational_profile\": {\n      \"model_event_rate_per_s_per_active\": 10,\n      \"active_child_max\": 6,\n      \"code_default_max_concurrent\": 2,\n      \"deployed_max_concurrent\": 6,\n      \"max_waiters_effective\": \"min(configured MAX_SLOT_WAITERS, 2*effective MAX_CONCURRENT) в общей _SlotBulkhead admission; code-default2/4, deploy6/12. Deployment6/12 unchanged, configured waiters variable не повышать.\",\n      \"server_resource_manager\": \"один per-Server owner для bounded process/socket leases, после старта процесса, без parent live sockets before child exec\",\n      \"threads_per_worker_upper_bound\": 55,\n      \"thread_accounting\": \"Parent admitted bound55=1accept+18handlers(6active+12waiters)+6supervisor/setup+6SSE readers+6prompt delivery workers+12helper stdout/stderr drains+6parent bookkeeping. Helper EOF/TERM/serve poll uses one single-thread main loop per slot, no helper watcher threads;<=6 helper processes. serve logs route to helper stderr, stdout reserved for one handshake; parent still accounts2drains/slot. At most6 auxiliary identity/lsof/ps probes total,1per slot,serial nonoverlap with reconnect/cleanup, executed on existing supervisor/helper loops. Peak system processes1bridge+6helper+6serve+6probe=19. Reaper startup-only, no request overlap. Rejected unadmitted ThreadingHTTPServer handlers may be transient:55 is admitted bound; H3 must measure rejection peaks, not claim arbitrary flood defense.\",\n      \"stdout_queue_max_events\": 4096,\n      \"new_transport_queue_max_bytes\": 1048576,\n      \"new_transport_max_sse_frame_bytes\": 1048576,\n      \"new_transport_accumulated_output_budget_bytes\": 8388608,\n      \"byte_limits_policy\": \"Только новый enabled transport, суммарный parent queue/raw/parser/dedup/visible output budget на request контролируется; превышение -> прежняя error shape + explicit output_overflow и cleanup, не молчаливое drop. Не вводить новый запрет на размер accepted prompt и не менять legacy limits. При нагрузке/длинном reasoning H3 измерить Python overhead и CPU.\",\n      \"first_status_delay_s\": 0.3,\n      \"status_heartbeat_s\": 5.0,\n      \"first_event_timeout_s\": 20,\n      \"first_token_timeout_s\": 60,\n      \"stall_timeout_s\": 60,\n      \"client_detect_s\": 5,\n      \"client_probe_interval_s\": 0.25,\n      \"client_keepalive_s\": 2,\n      \"client_write_timeout_s\": 0.5,\n      \"cleanup_budget_s\": 1.2,\n      \"ready_budget_s\": 3.0,\n      \"session_setup_budget_s\": 2.0,\n      \"slot_wait_s\": 15,\n      \"spawn_rate_per_s\": 1,\n      \"spawn_burst\": 1,\n      \"total_deadline_s\": 1800,\n      \"estimate_status\": \"Units MiB. EVD-079 final actual helper peak=31.718750; helper_estimate36.0 reserves 4.281250 for Stage3 helper code/lease/drain bookkeeping (design allowance, not live proof). Serve idle156.8 + helper36.0 =192.8; probe8.0 -> combined200.8; per_slot_ceiling216.0 gives15.2>=15 MiB for103KB prompts.6*216=1296 shared;1296+256=1552.0<=0.80*2048=1638.4; station headroom86.4.6slots/12waiters/cap3 unchanged. H3 NOT_RUN until live6parallel103KB×3; any actual slot>216 or total>1638.4 blocks H7 without waiver. Helpers/probes/load must be summed, not omitted.\",\n      \"pre_spawn_admission_budget_s\": 5.0,\n      \"admission_policy\": \"_StartupGate + _SpawnRateLimiter делят один<=5.0s deadline на attempt; никакой суммы независимых5+5. Spawn token hard, gate wait fail-open только в остатке.\",\n      \"session_setup_scope\": \"POST /api/session + GET /api/event subscription armed<=2.0s до prompt; POST /prompt worker waits по first_event20/first_token60,total1800 и concurrent SSE, не по session_setup.\",\n      \"first_event_anchor\": \"serve prompt_send_start; first valid current-session execution SSE only; HTTPready/headers/control ignored; O-EXIT first_event_ms measured from request t0\",\n      \"data_isolation\": \"OPENCODE_DB=:memory:; preserve standard XDG_DATA_HOME/auth; owned zen-serve-state-* state/tmp with finally+crash reaper.\",\n      \"serve_health\": {\n        \"threshold\": 3,\n        \"ttl_s\": 120.0,\n        \"scope\": \"per Server/binary key, new auto requests; no model breaker protocol failures\"\n      },\n      \"http_sockets_per_serve_max\": 3,\n      \"fd_accounting\": {\n        \"parent_baseline\": 36,\n        \"admitted_client_sockets\": 18,\n        \"serve_http_lanes\": 18,\n        \"stdout_stderr_drains\": 12,\n        \"reserved_port_sockets\": 6,\n        \"lsof_capture_pipes\": 6,\n        \"parent_watchdog_pipes\": 6,\n        \"open_lease_files\": 6,\n        \"parent_upper_bound\": 114,\n        \"configured_envelope\": 128,\n        \"aggregate_estimate\": \"Steady parent108 plus transient6lifeline read ends=114<=envelope128. Systemwide conservative128+6serve*20+6helper*8+6probe*8=344descriptors; probe=lsof OR ps identity,at most1/slot,no overlap. Helper per-process8 upper design includes std0/1/2,one transient lease file/atomic temp,DEVNULL/child-launch descriptors and select bookkeeping; measure H3 each process and transient peaks,do not claim aggregate<256.\",\n        \"lifeline_definition\": \"6 parent lifeline_w write ends; transient parent lifeline_r read end closed immediately after Popen. During setup read+write momentarily add<=6FD; terminal no leaks. helper stdin fd0 is lifeline_r, never inherits write end.\",\n        \"transient_lifeline_read_ends\": 6\n      },\n      \"process_accounting\": \"Exactly1bridge parent ->at most6 helper_proc ->at most6 serve_proc, each pair same child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; <=6 transient bounded lsof/ps identity probes, at most1/slot (no overlap),peak19 processes including bridge. One model attempt token creates one helper/serve pair; MAX_TOTAL_SPAWNS=3 counts pairs/actual serve launches, never free retries; probes auxiliary bounded and accounted. Serve start_new_session=False, helper=True; no alternate process topology.\",\n      \"p99_criteria\": {\n        \"status\": \"DESIGN_TARGET_NOT_MEASURED\",\n        \"normal\": \"At declared0.2req/s, admitted6active/12waiters, healthy single attempt: empirical end-to-end completion p99<=180.0s including slot/admission/setup/cleanup; H1/H2/H3 record sample count and nearest-rank p99, never infer p99 from3samples.\",\n        \"degraded\": \"Bounded synthetic failure-to-first-token profile with three60s watchdog attempts: elapsed<=231.6s (=3*60+51.6 aux), not <=180.0s. Fault-injection batch>=100eligible requests reports nearest-rank p99<=231.6s and cap3; retry budget may stop earlier. First-event-only failure profile3*20+51.6=111.6s. Healthy actual generation+post-token stalls remain under total1800s,231.6 is not universal completion guarantee.\",\n        \"rollout\": \"Both normal p99 target and degraded-profile budget must be measured independently; no runtime SLA claim from arithmetic. If normal p99>180 or degraded synthetic p99>231.6, keep disabled and return evidence, do not increase caps/timeouts.\"\n      },\n      \"stall_heartbeat_interval_s\": 15.0,\n      \"rss_accounting\": {\n        \"unit\": \"MiB\",\n        \"serve_idle_observed\": 156.8,\n        \"serve_evidence\": \"EVD-071 owner-supplied idle, not6parallel peak\",\n        \"helper_estimate\": 36.0,\n        \"helper_observed_peak_mib\": 31.71875,\n        \"helper_evidence\": \"EVD-079\",\n        \"helper_stage3_reserve_mib\": 4.28125,\n        \"pair_estimate\": 192.8,\n        \"probe_peak_estimate\": 8.0,\n        \"combined_with_probe_estimate\": 200.8,\n        \"per_slot_ceiling\": 216,\n        \"per_slot_headroom_estimate\": 15.2,\n        \"shared_ceiling\": 1296,\n        \"parent_ceiling\": 256,\n        \"full_design_ceiling\": 1552.0,\n        \"H3_full_sum_max\": 1638.4,\n        \"station_headroom_mib\": 86.4,\n        \"status\": \"PARTIAL_OBSERVATION: isolated early helper measured in EVD-079; 36.0 includes explicit Stage3 code/lease/drain reserve. Serve156.8 is idle; probe8 and loaded Stage3 not measured. H3 six live103KB slots plus bridge/helper/serve/probe peaks remains NOT_RUN; per-slot>216 or station>1638.4 fails H3 and blocks H7 without waiver.\"\n      },\n      \"fd_and_threads\": {\n        \"substitution\": \"Units MiB. EVD-079 final actual helper peak=31.718750; helper_estimate36.0 reserves 4.281250 for Stage3 helper code/lease/drain bookkeeping (design allowance, not live proof). Serve idle156.8 + helper36.0 =192.8; probe8.0 -> combined200.8; per_slot_ceiling216.0 gives15.2>=15 MiB for103KB prompts.6*216=1296 shared;1296+256=1552.0<=0.80*2048=1638.4; station headroom86.4.6slots/12waiters/cap3 unchanged. H3 NOT_RUN until live6parallel103KB×3; any actual slot>216 or total>1638.4 blocks H7 without waiver. Helpers/probes/load must be summed, not omitted. FD114<=128 parent,344 aggregate design;55admitted parent threads,19process peak; previous FD/thread accounting unchanged.\",\n        \"verification_ids\": [\n          \"VER-005\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"memory_closure_check\": {\n      \"status\": \"PASS\",\n      \"unit\": \"MiB\",\n      \"lhs_mib\": 1552.0,\n      \"rhs_mib\": 1638.4,\n      \"substitution\": \"W*Mem_rss_worker_max+Mem_shared_max=1*256+1296=1552.0 <=0.80*2048=1638.4 MiB; station headroom86.4 MiB\",\n      \"evidence_level\": \"design estimate only; NOT measured runtime PASS\",\n      \"runtime_gate\": \"Units MiB. EVD-079 final actual helper peak=31.718750; helper_estimat