w closed every exit. Stage3/H0/H9 remain NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"verification_ids\": [\n        \"VER-005\"\n      ],\n      \"helper_cli_contract\": \"Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\"\n    },\n    \"O_EXIT_v1\": {\n      \"status\": \"PASS\",\n      \"substitution\": \"Один O-EXIT/v1 до любого early return имеет mode/model/status, transport/first_event_ms/ttft_ms (null допустим до event), exit_reason, retries,total_spawns,duration; code first_event_timeout/first_token_timeout/stall_timeout/client_gone не теряется. first_event_ms только valid current-session execution SSE после prompt, относительно request t0; 