per/serve/descendants/lease/temp roots,0 foreign signals/deletions including PID/PGID reuse. Separately kill/disable helper, restart bridge with retained lease ->safe startup reaper; this is recovery scenario, not immediate EOF success.50 normal cancellation cycles return all counters/FD/thread/pipe counts to0; lifeline_w closed every exit. Stage3/H0/H9 remain NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"Entire normal Keep-Alive path(permission/form/reply/interrupt/DELETE),including50controls:exactly1 lsof/successful spawn and1retained control TCP. Separate explicit control-socket reconnect scenario permits only2nd lsof<=0.35s outside reply0.25s/cleanupAPI0.20s; spies distinguish the scenarios; urgent control disconnect is fail-closed,never lsof wait.3forced lsof timeouts ->3ServeHealth failures->DEGRADED,nextauto has0serve/helper/lsof Popen. Check listener_pid==serve_pid and pgid==helper_proc.pid; count lifeline2ends during setup/one parent end thereafter,all0afterfinally; parentFD<=128,allprocess344design,55admittedthreads,19systemprocesspeak; probes1/slot. H3 measures actual RSS/FD/thread/ports and rejects excess without raising limits.\"\n    ],\n    \"tools_matrix\": [\n      \"every split point and single-char deltas for both tags, JSON embedded close strings/code quoting existing fixtures\",\n      \"stream content before open tag visible immediately, pending genuine prefix<=12 plus inherited code-context lookahead\",\n      \"unparsed/open genuine blocks stripped by existing wrapper, no raw tool tags in SSE content\",\n      \"native call lifecycle normalized/dedup per call-id, mapped/unmapped behavior identical; no auto allow\",\n      \"step.ended tokens input/output/cached/reasoning counted once then tool finish, no followup synthetic step\",\n      \"early legacy error may recover; late transient/fatal error and incomplete recovery same on fake v2\",\n      \"existing reasoning_interrupted and interrupted cleanup across delta boundaries\",\n      \"permission.asked {data.id,sessionID,action,resources,source} ->POST reply {decision:reject},status204; both ask_reject/deny modes; POST prompt may stayblocked while reject executes on separate control socket; never once/always/allow.\",\n      \"Frozen wire tokens.cache.read/write ->canonical tokens{input,output,cached=cache.read,reasoning}; mutate delta path/cache envelope/permission lifecycle ->independent oracle fail, step assistantMessageID dedup, not invented wire stepID.\",\n      \"Actual input.started(name), input.delta, input.ended(text), called(input,executed), progress(metadata), success/failed. Correlate data.sessionID+assistantMessageID+id; accumulate tool name/input, normalize tool_use part{tool,state{input,status}}+call_id. permission.asked отправляет decision=reject немедленно по отдельному control lane. Никакого встроенного allow или выполнения bridge-side. On input.ended save $.data.text and parse JSON as object with runtime validation. Prefer called.data.input if present and valid; if called absent before failed/step.ended use completed input.ended.text, including streaming→failed. Never emit partial JSON; dedup by sessionID/assistantMessageID/call id. Both paths give identical mapped DSH tool_calls. Invalid JSON follows existing incomplete/unmapped recovery, not invented empty args.\",\n      \"For form.created first inspect nested data.form object: if data.form.sessionID==active_session_id and data.form.id is a nonempty string, latch single-turn/Step2 barrier and IMMEDIATELY send POST /api/session/{id}/form/{formID}/cancel on retained control lane<=0.25s, then interrupt<=0.10s, BEFORE validating title/fields/metadata or emitting invalid_serve_event. EVD-073 source Form.Info requires id,sessionID,title,fields (only root metadata optional; field-level title/required optional). Missing root title is a schema discrepancy but safety cancel is authoritative: successful cancel+interrupt completes normal cancelled attempt with ServeHealth+0/UpstreamBreaker+0, no watchdog60s wait and no Step2. This does not relabel source title optional. Missing/invalid id or sessionID ->immediate fail-closed(no foreign cancel); cancel failure/control disconnect ->immediate fail-closed; parent finally killpg(child_pgid) completes<=1.2s, no watchdog wait. Valid foreign nested sessionID ignored with0foreigncontrol. form.cancelled.data.id/sessionID settles only same owned form; not model token or first-event.\",\n      \"permission reject and form cancel MUST immediately interrupt; Step2 output0 even if emitted concurrently, completed input.ended JSON tool mapping same as called.input. Cancel/reject failure fail-closed.\",\n      \"Env secret-sentinel matrix standalone/opencode-go/base_url/static;0parent API_KEY/TOKEN/SECRET/arbitrary env, required config/models/auth preserved.\"\n    ],\n    \"baseline_matrix\": [\n      \"two original budget fixtures:3 spawns, no fourth tool result, stop; separate fixture unmapped->incomplete->calls within3 proves counter separation\",\n      \"fresh _Resilience/_RetryBudget per test, reverse fixed ordering plus isolated/full runner\",\n      \"all17 existing modules untouched except the3 acknowledged assertions/isolation in test_step_interruption; no Google changes\",\n      \"AC-026 / VER-005 / Clean-Room L2: tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py создаёт tmp_path / \\\"dynamic_config.json\\\" с {\\\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\\\":true}; monkeypatch.setattr(server, \\\"DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH\\\", cfg_path, raising=False). При переносе только этого testfile на непропатченный origin/dev нет AttributeError: реально POST /v1/chat/completions, RED именно на поведенческих realtime chunk intervals (чтение socket до upstream release), GREEN на новом коде. Та же Server instance: атомарно false в cfg_path ->следующий запрос run без restart; true ->serve при test eligibility override/native, deletion/invalid JSON/nonbool/unreadable ->false; unchanged (st_mtime_ns,st_size) ->нет reopen. Новый cfg stat key для переключения обеспечивается и проверяется