ve ServeHealth1/Upstream0 vs0/1; no delivery/retry weakening.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/fallback_decision_table/rows/4\",\n        \"/decisions/0/details/fallback_decision_table/rows/5\",\n        \"/verification_surface/4/process_resource_oracle/counter_branches\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-004\",\n      \"pass\": \"a3\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; future implementation/live gates NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A3-F-007\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"AD-003.cleanup cites EVD-055 for _stop_proc descendants; EVD-056 remains worktree evidence only.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/2/details/cleanup\"\n      ],\n      \"verification\": \"EVD-075 observed isolated Ruff/hash proof; EVD-076 observed isolated type/catalog proof; JSON/schema/coverage invariants checked before handoff. VER-004 all3 and VER-005/H0..H9 NOT_RUN; external a4 verdict pending.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FU-005\",\n      \"pass\": \"a3\",\n      \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\n      \"resolution_level\": \"ARCHITECTURE_DELTA; future implementation/live gates NOT_RUN\",\n      \"source_findings\": [\n        \"PANEL-A3-F-008\"\n      ],\n      \"changes_made\": \"Normal whole Keep-Alive path exactly1lsof/spawn; second proof only separate explicit control reconnect<=0.35s outside fast budgets;spies distinguish;urgent brokencontrol failclosed.\",\n      \"packet_locations\": [\n        \"/decisions/0/details/listener_ownership/protocol\",\n        \"/resilience_gates/C_MULT/C-MULT-I5/oracle\",\n        \"/