Stage3/H0..H9 NOT_RUN.\",\n      \"decision_required_human\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rework_summary\": {\n    \"pass\": \"a5→a6\",\n    \"iteration\": 6,\n    \"resolved\": [\n      \"RW-001\",\n      \"RW-002\",\n      \"FU-001\",\n      \"FU-002\"\n    ],\n    \"memory\": \"Units MiB. EVD-079 final actual helper peak=31.718750; helper_estimate36.0 reserves 4.281250 for Stage3 helper code/lease/drain bookkeeping (design allowance, not live proof). Serve idle156.8 + helper36.0 =192.8; probe8.0 -> combined200.8; per_slot_ceiling216.0 gives15.2>=15 MiB for103KB prompts.6*216=1296 shared;1296+256=1552.0<=0.80*2048=1638.4; station headroom86.4.6slots/12waiters/cap3 unchanged. H3 NOT_RUN until live6parallel103KB×3; any actual slot>216 or total>1638.4 blocks H7 without waiver. Helpers/probes/load must be summed, not omitted.\",\n    \"helper_contract\": \"Helper argv=[sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart]; helper_proc=subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \\\"-I\\\", str(Path(__file__).resolve()), \\\"--serve-helper\\\", attempt_id, str(port), str(OPENCODE_BIN), str(lease_dir), str(os.getpid()), parent_lstart], stdin=lifeline_r, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=True, close_fds=True, env=serve_env); child_pgid=helper_proc.pid; serve_proc=subprocess.Popen([opencode_bin, \\\"serve\\\", \\\"--hostname\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", str(port)], stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, start_new_session=False, close_fds=True, env=serve_env). args=sys.argv[2:] must have len(args)==6; parse attempt_id, port_text, opencode_bin, lease_dir_text, parent_pid_text, parent_lstart. Before any spawn or state I/O: reject length mismatch; require nonempty attempt_id/opencode_bin/lease_dir_text/parent_lstart, decimal integers port_text/parent_pid_text, 1<=int(port_text)<=65535 and int(parent_pid_text)>0. Convert lease_dir=Path(lease_dir_text) and parent_pid=int(parent_pid_text); use only the passed isolated lease directory. opencode_bin is the parent-resolved str(OPENCODE_BIN) after configuration/in-process monkeypatch, never a module constant read by helper. serve_env is the already sanitized parent environment, copied without OPENCODE_BIN; do not add OPENCODE_BIN or widen any OPENCODE_*/FAKE_* whitelist. Child stdout/stderr PIPEs must be continuously drained/forwarded by the bounded single-thread helper loop to helper stderr; helper stdout remains reserved for handshake, parent keeps exactly two drain lanes per slot. Drain-ready pipes concurrently with fd0 EOF/TERM and child poll, bounded per-tick work, no child pipe wait delaying EOF. Preserve lease/handshake/listener ownership and terminal_quiescence invariants. Early isolated dispatcher in server.py: top-level only minimal stdlib imports (json, os, signal, subprocess, sys, time, Path, select/resource as needed; existing typing import retained unchanged for the frozen no-new-Any gate) and typed def _run_serve_helper_cli(args: list[str]) -> int. Immediately afterwards: if sys.argv[1:2] == [\\\"--serve-helper\\\"]: raise SystemExit(_run_serve_helper_cli(sys.argv[2:])); else: import all normal-server-only modules, including http.client, sqlite3, from http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer, and after sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)), static import zen_catalog as zc. Imports inside else prevent Ruff module-level E402; terminating SystemExit branch makes those names definitely assigned for the normal path in basedpyright1.40.2. No helper execution reaches reload_catalog() (original server.py:163), _DEFAULT_RESILIENCE, main/HTTP startup, LOG_PATH/DYNAMIC_CONFIG_PATH initialization, or any access to state/zen-catalog.json, logs/bridge.log, dynamic_config.json. No importlib transform, inline -c source, new module, suppressions, or frozen-slice changes. --serve-helper/attempt_id/port occupy fixed argv[3]/argv[4]/argv[5] after executable,-I,resolved script path. Startup reaper checks full untruncated ps -ww argv, exact script realpath and all six manifest arguments, UID/PID/lstart/PGID; no secrets/password/prompt in argv or lease.\",\n    \"ruff\": \"Explicit root/ruff.toml on every format/check plus exact write-copy byte equality/frozen checks; hostile XDG test observed pass.\",\n    \"budget\": \"arch_panel_to_architect5/5 unchanged; no further cycle authorized\",\n    \"council\": \"External a6/r15 pending; no Council PASS/ARCH_GATE_PASS issued\",\n    \"dissent\": {\n      \"seat\": \"realist\",\n      \"family\": \"Muse\",\n      \"round\": \"D1 panel/arch/r14\",\n      \"priority\": \"non-blocking\",\n      \"majority\": \"xAI+Anthropic 2/3 blocking\",\n      \"preserved\": true,\n      \"outcome\": \"RW-001 blocking as agreed by majority; dissent retained without reclassifying consensus.\"\n    },\n    \"not_run\": [\n      \"actual Stage3\",\n      \"H0..H9\",\n      \"external a6/r15\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\nARTIFACT_END>>>\n<<<ARTIFACT .ai-team/runs/analyst-teamlead-zen-realtime-reasoning-20261025/receipts/arch-gate.json sha256=1474e461b6a7f82dfa8fa59ad8b37fc470e547012a0362cc5bdfa76acf65c9e5\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"gate\": \"ARCH_GATE\",\n  \"status\": \"PASS\",\n  \"run_id\": \"analyst-teamlead-zen-realtime-reasoning-20261025\",\n  \"criticality\": \"S2\",\n  \"packet_sha256\": \"88c02c37a7ca0be3d317217f23289dba07ddc681d922db207c7680a779128b6b\",\n  \"verification_surface_sha256\": \"4886ffa8669391618891b8e180a3443879043711da25bfe909bb6887ea6b924f\",\n  \"protected_paths_sha256\": \"98f7f5f54622baf379b40bad458cf3ef2a1952644fb79fb662ebe11f70659d8b\",\n  \"architect_worktree_sha256\": \"2bcabd4d9c9bdf3d108afbae3344a2b4e7350c7d697355529fc2360d73eb7334\",\n  \"materialized_targets\": 0\n}\nARTIFACT_END>>>\n<<<ARTIFACT .ai-team/runs/analyst-teamlead-zen-realtime-reasoning-20261025/architecture/architectu